  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Assistance, Shelter Innovation, Water Harvesting and Accelerated Education for Displacement-Affected Communities in Cabo D</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The central problem this intervention seeks to address is that vulnerable displacement-affected households in Cabo Delgado continue to face overlapping barriers to protection, safe living conditions, water resilience and education, while humanitarian actors continue to operate in a constrained and underfunded environment requiring sustained coordination. These barriers reinforce one another and cannot be addressed effectively through isolated sectoral activities.</narrative>
  </description>
